    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td> </td> <td>List I</td> <td> </td> <td>List II</td> </tr> <tr> <td>A.</td> <td>Gauss’s law of magnetostatics</td> <td>i.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∮</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>V</mi></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>B.</td> <td>Faraday’s law of electro magnetic induction</td> <td>ii.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∮</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>C.</td> <td>Ampere’s law</td> <td>iii.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∮</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>l</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>D.</td> <td>Gauss’s law of electrostatics</td> <td>iv.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∮</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>l</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></math></td> </tr> </tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
