  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Gauss’s law of magnetostatics:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∮</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Faraday’s law of electro magnetic induction:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∮</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>l</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p>Ampere’s law:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∮</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>l</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>Gauss’s law of electrostatics:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∮</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>V</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
